            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-mad.webp",
            text: _("You dare use that bow against us? The Moonbows belong to the elves; you know nothing about them and have no right to lay a hand on one!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "leader2",
            text: _("I know enough: I’ve trained in archery my entire life and never seen a bow to rival this one. Fighting with it is my best chance at beating you!"),
