          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "leader2",
            text: _("The rebels are too powerful! Mercy, Konrad! I’m just doing my duty to defend my country, as ordered by my sovereign, the queen!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-$konrad_portrait_base-mad.webp",
            text: _("Surrender your elven weapon, and swear an oath to never again take up arms against me or my allies. I am the true sovereign in Wesnoth, and will give you but one chance at redemption."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "leader2",
            text: _("But Asheviere will kill me! ...I suppose you will too. If you really are the heir, and an elf-lover besides, then I suppose our pillage does most rightfully belong to you. Here, take it, and leave the rest of us alive!"),
          },
